@Rest_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5097

### Registro
POST {{Rest_API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba@correo.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!",
  "displayName": "Usuario Prueba",
  "username": "prueba",
  "phoneNumber": "+50412345678",
  "birthDate": "2000-01-15T00:00:00Z",
  "country": "Honduras",
  "bio": "Futbol, nivel intermedio"
}

### Login
POST {{Rest_API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba@correo.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### Mi perfil (pegar el idToken)
GET {{Rest_API_HostAddress}}/api/Miembro
Authorization: Bearer TU_ID_TOKEN

### Buscar
POST {{Rest_API_HostAddress}}/api/Miembro/buscar
Authorization: Bearer TU_ID_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "country": "Honduras",
  "username": "prueba"
}
